nna tholige ninna kasuva kodu Rama","Kannu kaledaru ninna kanasu kodu Rama","Nanna haranake ninna charana kodu Rama ||2||"],["Kousalyeyaguvenu madilaliru Rama","Vydhehiyaguvenu odanadu Rama","Padhukeya thaleyalidu bharathanaguve Rama","Sahawasa kodu nanu soumitri Rama","Sugrivanaguvenu sneha kodu Rama","Hanuma naguve ninna sewa kodu Rama","Hanuma naguve ninna sewa kodu Rama","Shabariyaguve ninna bhava kodu Rama","Raghu Rama raghu Rama raghu Rama raghu Rama ||3||"],["Madilali marana kodu na Jatayuvu Rama","Mudiyali adiyanidu na Ahalyeyu Rama","Na Vibhishana Sharanubhava kodu Rama","Nannoliha Ravanage sava kodu Rama","Kanniru kareyuvenu nannathana kale Rama","Ninnolage karaguvenu nirmoha kodu Rama","Ninnolage karaguvenu nirmoha kodu Rama","Raghu Rama Raghu Rama Raghu Rama Raghu Rama ||4||"],["Rutha nine ruthu nine sruthi nine Rama","Mathi nine gathi nine dhyuthi nine Rama","Arambha asthitva antya ni Rama","Purna ni prakata ni ananda Rama","Hara nine hari nine brahma ni Rama","Hara nine hari nine brahma ni Rama","Guri nine guru nine arivu ni Rama","Guri nine guru nine arivu ni Rama","Raghu Rama Raghu Rama Raghu Rama Raghu Rama","Nagu Rama naga Rama jagaRama Rama ||5||"],["Innastu bekenna hrudayakke Rama","Ninnastu nemmadhiyu ellihudhu Rama","Rama Rama Rama Rama"],["Rama Rama Rama Rama","Rama Rama Rama Rama","Rama Rama Rama Rama"]],"aligned":false,"video":"E-rrkoMmeX4","videos":["E-rrkoMmeX4"],"sourceUrl":"https://bhakthilahari.com/2020/10/10/%e0%b2%87%e0%b2%a8%e0%b3%8d%e0%b2%a8%e0%b2%b7%e0%b3%8d%e0%b2%9f%e0%b3%81-%e0%b2%ac%e0%b3%87%e0%b2%95%e0%b3%86%e0%b2%a8%e0%b3%8d%e0%b2%a8-%e0%b2%b9%e0%b3%83%e0%b2%a6%e0%b2%af%e0%b2%95%e0%b3%8d%e0%b2%95/"},{"slug":"jaya-janakikanta-jaya","titleKn":"ಜಯ ಜಾನಕೀಕಾಂತ ಜಯ","titleEn":"Jaya janakikanta jaya","form":"pada","composer":"purandara-dasa","ankita":"ಪುರಂದರ ವಿಠಲ","raga":null,"tala":null,"stanzas":[["ಜಯ ಜಾನಕೀಕಾಂತ ಜಯ ಸಾಧುಜನ ವಿನುತ ||"],["ಜಯತು ಮಹಿಮಾನಂತ ಜಯ ಭಾಗ್ಯವಂತ ಜಯ ಜಯ ||"],["ದಶರಥನ ಮಗ ವೀರ ದಶಕಂಠ ಸಂಹಾರ","ಪಶುಪತೀಶ್ವರ ಮಿತ್ರ ಪಾವನ ಚರಿತ್ರ","ಕುಸು